Package: normpatch
Type: Package
Title: Robust Normalization Factor Estimation for RNA-seq Count Data
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person(given = "Jianqiang", family = "Sun",
    email = "sun@bitdessin.dev",
    role = c("cre", "aut"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3438-3199"))
Description: Implements normalization factor estimation for RNA-seq count data
    using methods based on the DEGES framework. These methods reduce the
    influence of differentially expressed features on the estimation of
    sample specific scaling factors in the presence of compositional imbalance.
